@title Hello — the sample chapter
@bg road
@mood calm

narrate This is the Saga engine's sample chapter. It ships so the engine has
something to run out of the box — replace it with your own story.
narrate See docs/SCENE-FORMAT.md for every instruction the engine understands.

@card stranger
stranger neutral "Hello. I am the sample scene."
narrate A short conversation is enough to show dialogue, a portrait and a choice.

@mood warm
stranger warm "Pick an option below to see how a choice is written."

choice
* "Say hello back."      => bonds+1
* "Ask how this works."  => truth+1
* "Say nothing."         => conviction+1
end

@label after
narrate And that is the whole sample. Now write yours.

@mood calm
stranger neutral "When you are ready, replace scenes/ and assets/sprites/ with your own."
